<title>CANADA: MAAX plans two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>MAAX plans two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAAX Inc said on Thursday that its plans a two-for-one split of its common shares.</p>
<p>The by-law relating to the stock split of common shares will be submitted to shareholders at a special general meeting of shareholders to be held on March 20, 1997.</p>
<p>The closing date of records for the purposse of the stock split is March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
